sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Redis as Redis Queue
    participant Worker as arq Worker
    participant Pipeline as LangGraph Pipeline
    participant Extractor as Message Extractor
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Client->>API: 1. POST /api/v1/ingest<br/>{share_url: "..."}
    API->>API: 2. Verify JWT
    API->>API: 3. Check rate limit
    API->>DB: 4. Create Source record
    DB-->>API: 5. source_id
    API->>DB: 6. Create Progress record
    API->>Redis: 7. enqueue_job("run_pipeline_task", source_id)
    API-->>Client: 8. 202 Accepted<br/>{source_id, status: "processing"}

    Redis->>Worker: 9. Dequeue job
    Worker->>DB: 10. Fetch Source
    DB-->>Worker: 11. Source data
    Worker->>Extractor: 12. Extract messages
    Extractor->>Extractor: 13. Playwright scraping
    Extractor-->>Worker: 14. raw_messages
    Worker->>DB: 15. Update source.status = "processing"
    Worker->>Pipeline: 16. Run LangGraph pipeline

    Pipeline->>Pipeline: 17. build_patches
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: 18. extract (LLM)
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: 19. index_route (LLM+Emb)
    Pipeline->>DB: 20. Create/Update Topics
    Pipeline->>DB: 21. Insert RawFacts, CodeBlocks, Tables

    loop For each dirty topic
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: 22. author_note (LLM)
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: 23. review (LLM)
        alt Rejected
            Pipeline->>Pipeline: 24. Retry author_note
        end
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: 25. diagram (LLM)
        Pipeline->>Pipeline: 26. format
        Pipeline->>DB: 27. Create/Update Notes
        Pipeline->>DB: 28. Create NoteVersions
    end

    Pipeline-->>Worker: 29. Pipeline complete
    Worker->>DB: 30. Update source.status = "completed"
    Worker-->>Redis: 31. Job complete

    Note over Client,Redis: Client polls GET /progress for updates
